  "title": [
    "[Elemental Confluence]"
  ],
  "description": [
    "A melange of roots and soil are brutally ripped from the ground by gusting vehement winds, soaking the dirt-choked air with the unusually balmy aromas of wet clay and loam.  Sloping away from the area, a deep cleft in the land yields to a broad crevasse alive with a gurgling mudflow.  Seemingly swallowing the entire environment with a deafening buzz, crackling flares of high-charged energy wail against the highland."
  ],
